# Stack
- UI: TanStack Start in SPA mode (`web/`), React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS 4,
  Zustand, Phosphor icons. One build serves web, Tauri desktop and Tauri mobile.
- Rust: `crates/core` (board model, validation, ts-rs types), `src-tauri`
  (Tauri 2, SQLite), `server` (Axum, sqlx/Postgres).

# Rules
- The board model lives in `crates/core/src/model.rs`. Change it there, then
  run `npm run gen:types`; never edit `web/src/lib/model.gen.ts` by hand.
- Take colors, radii and shadows from the Nocturne tokens in
  `web/src/styles.css` (`bg-surface`, `text-accent-300`, `shadow-card`…);
  inline styles only for computed geometry.
- Wrap Tauri-only APIs in `isTauri()` checks so the web build keeps working.
- Board edits go through the store (`web/src/store/board.ts`) with a
  `ChangeMode` so undo history stays correct.
- Validate every board write in Rust with `Board::from_json`.
- Keep `@status.md` current: progress, completed work, next steps, known issues.

# Checks
- `npm run typecheck && npm test`
- `cargo fmt --all --check && cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings && cargo test --workspace`
